INFO 2026-04-13 02:22:37,909 accounts.api_io [request_id=01B2BCA4-DAC0-4B07-A9CC-1E1D4A4E1752] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.300.31 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2MDQ3NDc3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzYwNDU2NzcsImp0aSI6IjBkNzdkODk5NTYxNzQ3MmQ5YWQ2NTkyOWQzMmFkZTUyIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.FuVVl3RDgSxdcU_QBJefq79gy3rpbJouRWTsJtWGAok", "X-Request-Id": "01B2BCA4-DAC0-4B07-A9CC-1E1D4A4E1752", "Content-Length": "1711"} body={"messages": [{"delivery_state": "pending", "content": "你好", "reasoning_expanded": false, "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "C81B52C2-8F12-4345-9195-DB7918820C6C", "tombstone": false, "thread_id": "0959164A-E908-4D00-950B-BF1B6AFD9AD4", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "role": "user", "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:22:26.097Z"}, {"delivery_state": "pending", "content": "你好！我是你的健康助手 Spark。有什么我可以帮你的吗？\n\n根据你的健康档案，我注意到你近期有一些健康记录（包括口腔检查、胃镜检查和体检报告），如果你需要针对具体健康状况的咨询、制定健康计划，或者有任何健康相关的问题，随时告诉我！😊", "reasoning_content": "用户只是简单地说了\"你好\"，这是一个问候。我应该友好地回应，并询问用户有什么可以帮助他们的。作为Spark健康助手，我可以提供健康相关的建议和服务。\n\n用户提供的系统提示中包含了成员近期病历摘要，显示用户（赵道凯）有一些健康问题：\n1. 阻生牙（智齿）\n2. 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n3. 窦性心动过缓\n4. 甲状腺囊肿（多发）\n5. 血常规有一些异常（中性粒细胞降低、淋巴细胞增高、血小板压积和计数增高）\n\n但既然用户只是打招呼，我不应该立即开始讨论这些病历，除非用户询问。我应该先友好地回应，并询问用户需要什么帮助。", "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "4022F062-0D10-4929-89D1-7F5FD1D821E7", "reasoning_expanded": false, "tombstone": false, "thread_id": "0959164A-E908-4D00-950B-BF1B6AFD9AD4", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "role": "assistant", "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:22:37.887Z"}]}
