INFO 2026-04-13 03:54:57,195 accounts.api_io [request_id=BAA644D5-42F5-4326-8693-6D99B203B7A2] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "localhost:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.300.31 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2MDUzMzI3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzYwNTE1MjcsImp0aSI6ImY5ZjcyM2IyM2Y0MDRkMzliNDM0YmMzYjM4OWUwY2NjIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.KarAi9UzdOLBoZpBX02Z2B4OSCMbqVAHvHVewXYUVnk", "X-Request-Id": "BAA644D5-42F5-4326-8693-6D99B203B7A2", "Content-Length": "1792"} body={"messages": [{"client_message_id": "6D47AC1E-837D-41B7-9F17-DD44493DB4ED", "content": "你会做什么", "role": "user", "thread_id": "7D021A4B-2542-444E-B7AA-3222D76FEBC5", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:46.347Z", "reasoning_expanded": false, "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "delivery_state": "pending", "kind": "text"}, {"role": "assistant", "delivery_state": "pending", "client_message_id": "56999445-A023-40D4-9293-D979FD56CE9D", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:57.149Z", "thread_id": "7D021A4B-2542-444E-B7AA-3222D76FEBC5", "kind": "text", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "content": "你好！我是 **Spark 健康助手**，专门帮你管理健康相关的事务。以下是我能做的事情：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 **健康数据追踪**\n- 查看步数、能量消耗、睡眠时长与质量\n- 分析运动记录（跑步、骑行、步行等）\n- 记录和统计饮食营养摄入\n\n## 📋 **病历与报告管理**\n- 查看和整理病历、体检报告\n- 生成结构化的健康卡片\n- 解读检查报告（需要拍照上传）\n\n## 💊 **用药管理**\n- 设置用药提醒\n- 记录药品信息\n- 提醒复查时间\n\n## 📅 **日程与提醒**\n- 创建健康相关的日历事件\n- 设置体检、复诊、用药提醒\n- 查看已有日程\n\n## 🗺️ **位置与导航**\n- 查找附近的医院、药店、健身房\n- 规划路线（步行、驾车、公交）\n- 查询天气，为出行做准备\n\n## 🔍 **知识查询**\n- 搜索健康知识\n- 查找学术文献\n- 检索你保存的笔记和文档\n\n## 📝 **记忆与笔记**\n- 保存重要健康信息到长期记忆\n- 创建知识文档\n\n---\n\n**你现在想做什么？** 比如查看今天的步数、记录一次饮食、或者设置一个提醒？", "tombstone": false}]}
