INFO 2026-04-13 04:24:10,361 accounts.api_io [request_id=E2C88372-359B-4C65-BF12-242AA680F301] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "localhost:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.300.31 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2MDU1MTA3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzYwNTMzMDcsImp0aSI6IjhjNjEyODExOWVmMDQzMzM5YzFmYTVlNmJjZjRkYzIwIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.cm5DNb-OGj7vv9frjzoPHJ6n9qoplUWGGn4CPl0YeAQ", "X-Request-Id": "E2C88372-359B-4C65-BF12-242AA680F301", "Content-Length": "1835"} body={"messages": [{"reasoning_expanded": false, "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "delivery_state": "pending", "client_message_id": "69B9A37E-4535-4292-9F78-87804A31554C", "thread_id": "768D37D7-6920-47AF-A61E-C874EAFAC5EF", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:06.752Z", "role": "user", "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"reasoning_expanded": false, "kind": "text", "content": "你好！👋 我是 Spark 健康助手，很高兴为您服务。\n\n我可以帮助您：\n- 📊 **健康数据查询**：步数、睡眠、运动、营养摄入等\n- 🏥 **医疗记录分析**：病历、体检报告解读\n- 💊 **用药提醒**：药物管理建议\n- 🩺 **健康建议**：基于您的健康状况提供个性化指导\n\n从您的近期病历来看，有以下几项需要注意：\n- **阻生牙**（建议择期拔除）\n- **慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流**\n- **窦性心动过缓**（无症状通常无需治疗）\n- **甲状腺囊肿**（建议专科治疗）\n- **血常规部分指标异常**（建议复查）\n\n请问您今天想了解什么？或者有什么健康问题需要咨询？😊", "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_content": "用户只是简单打了个招呼\"你好\"，这是一个普通的开场问候。我应该友好地回应，并介绍自己作为Spark健康助手的功能，可以询问用户有什么健康问题需要咨询。\n\n不需要调用任何工具，因为：\n1. 没有具体的健康问题需要查询\n2. 没有需要检索的数据需求\n3. 只是简单的开场对话\n\n我应该用中文友好回复，保持简洁专业。", "client_message_id": "F5589911-F124-4221-B390-B7D5207D7FE1", "thread_id": "768D37D7-6920-47AF-A61E-C874EAFAC5EF", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:10.351Z", "role": "assistant", "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_duration_ms": 719}]}
