 "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "5daca72c-36b5-4c7b-942c-59b637dc457b", "server_message_id": "14e048cd-a7e8-4fe3-b4f1-2cd327e37586", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T11:06:38.641000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T11:19:58.657888+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "63b091eb-819d-4232-9491-3893a8814b00", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "a2deca36-76e7-4733-ae9b-f599dc668d12", "server_message_id": "42995cf8-4802-4e2c-9bd9-52ec9ebb90d0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T11:07:22.513000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T11:19:58.663394+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "63b091eb-819d-4232-9491-3893a8814b00", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "923fae3a-1559-470d-a8c6-3fd2a47da9fd", "server_message_id": "e8f89b33-89b8-466a-a00e-2af4067b3b94", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T11:07:30.728000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T11:19:58.668383+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "63b091eb-819d-4232-9491-3893a8814b00", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "2c874219-bfb8-4aaf-a9ce-6c9ad03e7249", "server_message_id": "b6fdc4d1-08ee-49f5-b1c6-a24ab3e53d2f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T11:09:29.147000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T11:19:58.672793+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "2d8242f2-3dc8-4771-9162-f01a2f0e5a67", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "ba8ce291-9580-4019-9797-9dd170bf1e65", "server_message_id": "d5c96d34-89ac-4936-9e52-777f716f3eb4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T11:21:00.588000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T11:38:05.589783+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "2d8242f2-3dc8-4771-9162-f01a2f0e5a67", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "b660686e-20c6-400c-9ef0-0ff9d489f25a", "server_message_id": "4bd92d32-1f8b-4ae9-ac3e-8158b58e28fe", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:04:51.946000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:06:16.569128+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "49497a0e-2a62-4d0f-a2e6-3b33f8fe46ce", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "3fa82960-82e3-4c98-8c17-db6f089d839a", "server_message_id": "596d4d81-cff5-495d-915e-b08e26517868", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:13:50.049000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:13:57.866275+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "49497a0e-2a62-4d0f-a2e6-3b33f8fe46ce", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊我是Spark健康助手，如果你有健康科普、日常养生、饮食运动指导、常见症状相关的疑问，都可以随时告诉我哦~\n如果出现突发急症/严重不适，请第一时间前往附近正规医疗机构就诊，避免耽误病情。", "client_message_id": "26324136-09c5-4fd2-b5e1-5a312c233a00", "server_message_id": "862016db-afee-4628-8785-10c154ef0423", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:13:57.893000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:13:57.874089+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "49497a0e-2a62-4d0f-a2e6-3b33f8fe46ce", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "23c899fa-156d-41db-a213-fe42f8f3a3c1", "server_message_id": "bd259f66-39e1-4052-a27e-e185b7fb789d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:14:21.572000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:14:37.373803+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "49497a0e-2a62-4d0f-a2e6-3b33f8fe46ce", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我可以为你提供这些健康相关的帮助哦：\n1. 日常健康指导：比如不同人群的饮食搭配建议、适合普通人的运动方案、作息调整、日常养生科普等；\n2. 常见问题答疑：比如感冒、轻微腹泻、颈肩劳损这类常见小不适的家庭护理建议、常用药的使用注意事项科普等；\n3. 健康误区辟谣：可以帮你辨别网上流传的健康类伪科普、不靠谱的偏方。\n\n⚠️注意哦：我不能替代执业医师做疾病诊断、开处方，如果出现突发剧痛、持续严重不适，请第一时间前往正规医疗机构就诊，避免耽误病情。\n你有什么具体的健康相关问题都可以告诉我~", "client_message_id": "2951e742-217b-44eb-a888-5a1837989575", "server_message_id": "6dfc7302-ecb1-49e1-9c3d-6a36e14d5b18", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:14:37.372000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:14:37.379815+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "518d6650-6f03-4ab2-8a91-8c2d1bb80bc2", "server_message_id": "b1ba4bf0-487d-4039-99c3-cd924b2b0bcc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:21:29.538000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:21:39.110918+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊！我是Spark健康助手，可为你提供日常健康疑问解答、饮食运动指导、养生调理建议等健康相关帮助，有具体的健康需求可以随时告诉我~\n⚠️注意：如果涉及急症、重症请第一时间前往正规医院就诊，避免延误治疗哦。", "client_message_id": "53aad31d-9c7b-4b10-bb37-d9a99ce33331", "server_message_id": "a2ab560d-78be-4315-93f9-4453024421d2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:21:39.078000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:21:39.120228+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "bdcb6f48-a826-42e1-82d7-def4890b7636", "server_message_id": "8b35da31-42da-47d6-93db-e15195458051", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:39:53.361000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:01.073772+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊~ 要是有健康相关的疑问，比如膳食搭配、运动方案、常见小不适调理、作息调整这类问题，都可以直接和我说哦。\n如果是突发急症、重症的话，一定要第一时间去正规医院就诊，别自行处理耽误病情哈。", "client_message_id": "d5f0f6e1-4b84-4dc1-9fc6-70c2a90ea421", "server_message_id": "d5d58c31-455c-4778-af7f-1e37c86f92aa", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:01.086000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:01.091985+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "运行项目表格", "client_message_id": "d8ba38aa-60b9-439f-a7c4-552fb805e31e", "server_message_id": "277925cd-90e8-44b7-b771-366a6a7ff0ab", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:49.834000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:57.756561+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哦，我是专注健康领域咨询的Spark健康助手，项目表格搭建、运行这类办公相关的需求我没办法为你提供服务哒😅。\n如果你有日常健康疑问、饮食运动指导、常见不适调理这类健康相关的问题，可以随时告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "bdae196d-2b43-4d32-ad9f-1530c7dea5fb", "server_message_id": "259125d8-eb12-4d07-9819-98e3cd28182a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:57.728000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:40:57.767385+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "给我列出来", "client_message_id": "268c86d3-54ac-4385-b25f-a79745e7a579", "server_message_id": "9af108c9-46f3-4b99-97fb-f27ca665c910", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:41:11.510000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:41:25.213626+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "不好意思呀，我是专注健康领域的Spark健康助手，没办法为你提供项目表格相关的内容清单哦😅。\n\n如果你有健康相关的需求，比如需要减肥食谱清单、久坐不适缓解方法清单、家庭常备药清单这类健康类内容，可以明确告知你的具体需求，我会为你整理准确实用的相关内容~\n如果是突发急症、重症的话，请第一时间前往正规医院就诊，避免延误治疗哦。", "client_message_id": "5f949616-fa65-4603-9164-a05b49a8d323", "server_message_id": "2d130028-8d5b-416e-b003-90ed9b961353", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:41:25.238000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:41:25.222355+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "给我列一个清单", "client_message_id": "2255daaf-8581-4ae2-a480-6f8c3b0604be", "server_message_id": "efca32ba-7ec4-43e6-9fd1-f19c38f9ab8c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:41:39.005000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:42:04.691173+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我仅能提供健康相关的清单哦，如果你有具体的健康类需求（比如减肥餐清单、久坐族护颈清单、儿童防积食注意清单等）可以随时告知，先给你列一个大众最常用的「家庭常备非处方药品清单」供参考：\n---\n### 家庭常备药清单\n1. **感冒退热类**：对乙酰氨基酚、布洛芬（成人/儿童剂型按需备，严格按说明书年龄/体重对应用量服用）、对应症状的风寒/风热感冒颗粒\n2. **肠胃不适类**：蒙脱石散（止泻）、奥美拉唑（缓解胃酸过多引发的胃痛）、益生菌（调节肠道菌群）、口服补液盐Ⅲ（腹泻时补充电解质防脱水）\n3. **外伤护理类**：碘伏、医用棉签、防水创可贴、云南白药气雾剂（跌打损伤消肿）、莫匹罗星软膏（皮肤小破损消炎防感染）\n4. **过敏类**：氯雷他定/西替利嗪（缓解荨麻疹、过敏性鼻炎等突发过敏症状）\n5. **通用工具类**：电子体温计、生理性海盐水（洗鼻缓解鼻塞、冲洗小伤口都可用）\n---\n⚠️注意：所有药物都要按说明书用量服用，儿童、孕妇、慢性病患者用药前建议先咨询医生，症状持续2天以上不缓解请及时就医。\n如果需要其他类别的健康清单，可以告诉我具体需求~", "client_message_id": "e10a1293-1a6a-4bc5-b14c-a05350bbcf8d", "server_message_id": "335c4984-71a2-4094-b9f6-e89bbed031d1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:42:04.667000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:42:04.701590+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "健康饮食给我列一个清单，一个礼拜了", "client_message_id": "86fdf8e6-7d1c-4995-b648-366a929af00d", "server_message_id": "c4cbc61c-66d4-46a8-81dd-4b70a2fbe8c3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:42:21.245000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:43:10.914032+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4e507007-e159-4e21-a602-5832b6d8679e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "以下是适配无基础病、体重正常普通成年人的一周健康饮食清单，食材常见、操作简单，符合中国居民膳食指南推荐标准：\n---\n### 一周健康饮食清单\n#### 通用要求：每天油摄入25-30g，盐<5g，每日喝1500-1700ml温水，两餐饿了可以加1小把原味坚果/1个小水果当加餐\n| 天数 | 早餐 | 午餐 | 晚餐 |\n| ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- |\n| 周一 | 全麦面包2片+水煮蛋1个+无糖豆浆200ml+小番茄5颗 | 杂粮饭1碗（大米+少量藜麦/糙米）+清蒸鲈鱼100g+清炒西兰花200g | 玉米半根+鸡胸肉炒芹菜（鸡胸100g+芹菜150g）+凉拌海带丝1小碟 |\n| 周二 | 燕麦粥1碗（30g生燕麦煮）+水煮蛋1个+中等大小苹果1个 | 糙米饭1碗+番茄炖牛腩（牛腩100g+番茄200g）+白灼菜心200g | 山药1小段（100g）+虾仁滑蛋（虾仁80g+鸡蛋1个）+清炒油麦菜200g |\n| 周三 | 杂粮菜包1个+小米粥1小碗+凉拌黄瓜1小碟+水煮蛋1个 | 紫薯饭1碗+香煎鸡胸肉100g（少放油）+蒜蓉娃娃菜200g+凉拌木耳1小碟 | 南瓜粥1小碗+水煮虾10只（约100g）+清炒菠菜200g |\n| 周四 | 全麦三明治1个（全麦面包+生菜+煎蛋+低卡沙拉酱）+纯牛奶200ml+蓝莓1小盒 | 白米饭1碗+红烧豆腐1块+青椒炒瘦猪肉（瘦肉80g+青椒150g）+清炒茼蒿200g | 中等大小红薯1个+菌菇青菜汤1碗+凉拌鸡胸肉丝1小碟 |\n| 周五 | 玉米半根+水煮蛋1个+无糖酸奶1小盒+猕猴桃1个 | 杂粮饭1碗+少糖可乐鸡翅2个（约100g）+清炒荷兰豆200g+冬瓜汤1小碗 | 菜肉馄饨10个（薄皮菜肉各半）+清炒生菜200g |\n| 周六 | 南瓜发糕1小块+小米粥1碗+水煮蛋1个+小黄瓜1根 | 白米饭1碗+清蒸排骨100g+清炒豆角200g+番茄蛋花汤1小碗 | 藜麦粥1碗+香煎巴沙鱼100g+凉拌秋葵1小碟 |\n| 周日 | 全麦卷饼1个（卷生菜+鸡蛋+少量鸡胸肉）+纯牛奶200ml+草莓5颗 | 杂粮饭1碗+红烧鲫鱼半条（约100g）+清炒杏鲍菇200g+凉拌藕片1小碟 | 山药粥1小碗+鸡蛋炒木耳（鸡蛋1个+木耳150g）+清炒娃娃菜200g |\n---\n### 调整提示：\n1. 有减肥需求可以把精制主食量减1/3，多替换成玉米、红薯等粗杂粮；控糖人群要少喝粥、不吃添加糖的菜品；痛风人群要少选海鲜、动物内脏、浓肉汤类食材\n2. 同品类食材可以自由替换，比如不爱吃鲈鱼可以换其他淡水鱼，不爱吃西兰花可以换其他绿叶菜，保证每天吃够300-500g蔬菜、120-200g动物性蛋白即可。", "client_message_id": "ff567149-42c1-4fd0-b967-ce44e5304b3b", "server_message_id": "1c8e62e7-ccca-4fe9-92c3-3441e6e054ac", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T13:43:10.918000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T13:43:10.922007+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "94735fe7-40e8-4b98-8625-65c7994e4a98", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "50b90cfc-8fc7-4d5b-b160-1c4c27a31cd5", "server_message_id": "f54e6184-4894-4524-9dfb-291a3a7d7844", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:18:37.339000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:18:46.357824+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "94735fe7-40e8-4b98-8625-65c7994e4a98", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好😊我是Spark健康助手，您可以咨询日常健康护理、饮食运动指导、常见轻症应对、用药基础疑问等各类健康相关问题，请问有什么可以帮到您的？", "client_message_id": "313c0fec-4981-46d1-a9f6-8b7f1a258c2e", "server_message_id": "7a2b19f4-c2e4-4370-b6a5-cfe9890ea7ec", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:18:46.376000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:18:46.366772+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "94735fe7-40e8-4b98-8625-65c7994e4a98", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你还不", "client_message_id": "2444cc01-1714-4dff-a954-9ffd74d819d4", "server_message_id": "21eeb47d-f9f8-4286-8d4a-573d5f17a2ba", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:23:14.748000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:23:20.416234+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "94735fe7-40e8-4b98-8625-65c7994e4a98", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看起来你是不是还没输完想要咨询的内容呀😉不管是健康疑问、护理建议、饮食运动指导还是轻症应对相关的需求，都可以完整告诉我，我会尽力给你准确实用的解答哦。", "client_message_id": "ff1f287e-8bd7-4c7a-a2f7-18d91081b0a5", "server_message_id": "2025f5f9-8480-4dfa-952c-8711ed2e46e3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:23:20.453000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:23:20.426030+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好 你会做什么", "client_message_id": "6f9379c4-398b-4784-b83b-026d89b60382", "server_message_id": "e1f9d194-f4df-4c68-bd49-567bb6c12052", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:20.966000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:50.077737+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是Spark健康助手，可以为你提供这些实用健康相关的帮助哦：\n1. 日常健康指导：比如不同人群的膳食搭配、科学运动方案、作息调整建议、四季养生技巧等，帮你养成健康的生活习惯。\n2. 轻症应对建议：像感冒、落枕、轻微腹泻、晕车、蚊虫叮咬等常见小不适的居家缓解方法，还有常用药的使用注意事项科普。\n3. 健康避坑科普：帮你辨别「食物相克」「输液通血管」这类常见健康谣言，避开养生误区。\n4. 慢病护理参考：给高血压、糖尿病、高血脂等常见慢病患者提供日常监测、饮食禁忌、居家护理的参考建议。\n\n⚠️ 注意：我的所有建议都仅供健康参考，不能替代执业医师的当面诊断和治疗，如果有不明原因的剧痛、重症、急症，请第一时间前往医院就诊哦。", "client_message_id": "20112ff9-a40d-44d2-a941-a2042ff61b39", "server_message_id": "71b97cc0-6230-4d5e-a3d2-30b306ace85c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:50.077000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:50.092432+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会使用工具吗？", "client_message_id": "c0072318-5d2e-43c2-b7e2-2cc8006dcbdd", "server_message_id": "c95430b6-3bf6-4aa8-a989-a688d0d9edef", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:07.380000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.874850+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我目前暂时无法调用外部实时工具哦~不过我内置了经过专业审核的健康、医学相关知识库，能够满足大部分日常健康咨询需求，比如常见轻症居家缓解方法、不同人群膳食搭配指导、健康谣言辨别、慢病日常护理建议等，你有相关需求都可以直接说明。\n\n⚠️ 我的所有建议仅供参考，不能替代执业医师的当面诊断，如有急症、重症请第一时间就医哦。", "client_message_id": "ea30f5c5-296f-4f58-8dd1-f9febd11ee90", "server_message_id": "0776666f-ed96-49d0-9594-60662ec5144d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.808000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.882198+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "bf154115-c82d-44e9-a9c6-f2493d4a9d95", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好 你会使用工具吗", "client_message_id": "de6d97c8-40d9-4e91-844c-6facdb7de5ea", "server_message_id": "f9a05528-fa82-4468-a7ed-bec40eecc949", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:38:32.172000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:38:45.473003+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "bf154115-c82d-44e9-a9c6-f2493d4a9d95", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我目前暂不支持实时调用外部工具哦~\n不过我基于权威健康科普知识库，可以为你提供常见病科普、日常养生保健建议、合理膳食/科学运动指导、安全用药提示、就医参考建议等健康相关帮助，如果你有相关健康疑问都可以告诉我。", "client_message_id": "58665f7f-51b6-43ff-bad2-9a9fe72f8202", "server_message_id": "2e8167ad-9470-48e2-af63-71941896d24c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:38:45.388000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:38:45.489168+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "bf154115-c82d-44e9-a9c6-f2493d4a9d95", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好 你会做什么", "client_message_id": "811b844d-c839-4cbb-bcd1-0e8c5ad23cee", "server_message_id": "a354e3cd-6fe9-49fc-b51a-da7ef1c6ac6c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:22:50.387000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:23:07.217356+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "bf154115-c82d-44e9-a9c6-f2493d4a9d95", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是专注健康领域的AI助手，能为你提供这些实用帮助哦：\n1. 健康问题答疑：常见病科普、常见症状应对参考、特殊人群（老人/儿童/孕产妇等）健康注意事项、安全用药提示、就医相关建议等；\n2. 生活方式指导：科学运动方案制定/调整、膳食营养搭配建议、体重管理、睡眠改善方法、日常养生保健建议等；\n3. 健康管理参考：体检报告指标解读、慢性病日常管理指导、日常健康风险提示等。\n\n你如果有具体的健康相关需求，都可以直接告诉我~", "client_message_id": "7c7f1596-81e6-4e2c-9409-38d8973ad065", "server_message_id": "11f3ccd2-abd9-45c0-81a0-64292ed89216", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:23:07.255000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:23:07.231557+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "9db3dc2d-b932-48d5-935b-c47c4aea7a3c", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "3f91bcd4-00be-404f-8dfa-f88e8090622b", "server_message_id": "432607dd-5777-41fa-ae9b-7af08337139d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:30:55.318000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:02.297472+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "9db3dc2d-b932-48d5-935b-c47c4aea7a3c", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊我是你的专属健康助手Spark，不管是运动方案制定、饮食营养咨询、睡眠质量分析，还是健康档案查询、就医用药相关的问题，都可以告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "b99b5c53-81b8-49e7-a236-63dee4422cfb", "server_message_id": "0e04a9db-d46f-4103-b953-19a014132b31", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:02.348000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:02.306235+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "bf154115-c82d-44e9-a9c6-f2493d4a9d95", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "bdc5e9bd-307b-45b5-8bbb-b0b3a0a06110", "server_message_id": "90a07718-eccb-449e-bfe2-42cf2fe40125", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:30.752000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:37.218028+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "bf154115-c82d-44e9-a9c6-f2493d4a9d95", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "😆看来你现在心情很不错呀~如果之后有任何健康相关的需求，不管是咨询健康问题、要饮食/运动/睡眠调整建议，还是需要了解常见病应对方法，都可以随时和我说哦~", "client_message_id": "f4c10244-bbad-467a-a2c4-a843d9ac0124", "server_message_id": "32d80dbd-ac2d-4095-b93b-587bc83a411d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:37.280000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:31:37.226093+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "2cde0932-73c5-43bf-a21e-268380946bdc", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "691d438a-76cd-437f-ae02-38efffe8e156", "server_message_id": "ca32bd09-b642-4fce-818c-5323f9fa350f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:46:23.096000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:46:28.823290+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "2cde0932-73c5-43bf-a21e-268380946bdc", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊 我是你的专属健康助手Spark，不管是运动规划、饮食营养建议、睡眠质量分析，还是健康报告/处方解读这类需求，都可以随时告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "4072677b-6556-48f1-b8dd-bccf5c23e081", "server_message_id": "0895adcb-681b-473b-8fba-4207cb7f0f4e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:46:28.868000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:46:28.833058+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "9e42be6c-4c73-4874-a428-f0006f0c7687", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "hi", "client_message_id": "d7bacb32-6246-48fe-a9db-edb5b81eef84", "server_message_id": "96086a28-7734-4fd9-a5f4-6707880826fd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:46:53.383000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:03.955595+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "ni", "client_message_id": "a0b1d28b-4ad7-443a-88c3-82646adfadad", "server_message_id": "79764719-9611-4457-8a30-1fd110e33026", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:39.150000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:46.082764+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "Hi there! I'm your Spark Health Assistant. Feel free to share any health-related questions, needs such as fitness planning, diet advice, sleep/activity data query, medical record management, etc. I'm here to help you with accurate and actionable guidance.", "client_message_id": "58e8cd28-1719-4c64-9072-149f22673015", "server_message_id": "ee96198c-5eca-4ee3-af38-a82d1306369c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:46.148000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:46.091788+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "4f136dde-1294-4057-b8b4-f0189ec01156", "server_message_id": "14e7290a-cc2a-4c6c-8356-152b591f6ff3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:54.248000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:48:09.395116+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是专注于健康领域的智能助手，可以为你提供这些服务哦：\n1. **健康数据查询分析**：帮你调取/分析步数、热量消耗、睡眠记录、运动健身记录、营养摄入等健康数据，给出针对性的优化建议\n2. **饮食营养指导**：分析饮食结构、计算摄入热量/营养素，生成营养记录卡，定制膳食建议\n3. **运动健身支持**：制定运动计划、评估运动效果，结合消耗/摄入数据给出运动调整方案\n4. **睡眠健康管理**：查询睡眠周期数据、分析睡眠质量，提供改善睡眠的实用方法\n5. **医疗健康服务**：管理体检报告、病历、用药记录，查询健康档案，解答常见健康疑问、科普靠谱健康知识\n6. **实用辅助工具**：设置用药/体检提醒、查询附近医疗场所、规划出行路线、管理你的健康专属知识库等\n\n你现在有什么具体需求呀？", "client_message_id": "2d191dac-756c-4ceb-9ede-0c322d0052a9", "server_message_id": "e93bd7df-61b9-4988-acaa-47d763fa0267", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:48:09.466000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:48:09.402488+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈   吧", "client_message_id": "f49cc76d-4121-4f49-bc88-becc08067267", "server_message_id": "dd772ecc-7d02-473b-a255-c48c1d633a8d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:52.487000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:57.509662+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "😄 要是你之后有健康相关的问题，或者需要查运动、饮食、睡眠数据，或者要设置健康提醒之类的，随时和我说就好哦~", "client_message_id": "364c8cdc-01f5-4dfc-92c2-921b36039151", "server_message_id": "19157f37-2424-43a9-8335-81b896dd2371", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:57.487000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:57.518338+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "ad119b1c-34df-4c47-89a0-a0a1c436aa70", "server_message_id": "5a710698-c7cc-4823-b464-1a1208965ab5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:33.458000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:40.291794+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊！我是你的专属健康助手，不管是想查询运动、饮食、睡眠等健康数据，还是有健康相关的疑问、需要制定健康计划，都可以告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "80668f62-39d9-4847-96e7-9f78d9d8526e", "server_message_id": "90fc2bfa-466e-42ce-8b30-3b67a78b3658", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:40.239000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:40.303868+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "ac6fc050-b4a8-4339-9735-8fe4ad71e179", "server_message_id": "3cc6a818-daff-4515-9b6c-5d2511f0a17a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:36.333000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:55.743017+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我能帮你搞定多类健康相关的需求哦：\n1. 📊 健康数据查询分析：可查询/统计你的步数、热量消耗、饮食营养摄入、睡眠质量、运动记录等数据，支持摄入消耗对比、健康度分析，还能生成营养卡片、健康报告。\n2. 🩺 健康管理服务：帮你分析饮食/运动/睡眠结构、给出个性化优化建议，支持记录用药、病历、检查报告，生成结构化健康卡片、整理专属健康档案，需要解读体检报告、药盒、皮肤状态时也可以引导你上传图片识别。\n3. 📅 实用工具支持：可以设置健康相关的提醒（吃药、运动、体检等）、查询天气、规划出行路线、搜索周边适合的运动/健康餐饮场所等。\n4. 📚 健康知识查询：可检索健康相关的科普、专业文献，还能帮你整理健康笔记、保存重要健康信息。\n\n有具体需求随时告诉我就好~", "client_message_id": "0fc0cd8d-2c18-4439-b4e3-7bbf8d0c6a89", "server_message_id": "ca222406-dc57-4da3-aa4d-b60a98a80431", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:55.715000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:55.756243+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "运动记录呀查询", "client_message_id": "5d0d6a40-1038-49d0-b0ba-a0c633b43c02", "server_message_id": "294eeec5-cb6e-4030-8e03-aa874d9f6ee6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:04.045000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:11.508391+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "没问题呀，请告诉我你想要查询运动记录的时间段哦，需要提供开始日期和结束日期（格式例如2024-05-01），另外如果需要筛选跑步、步行、骑行这类特定运动类型也可以告诉我~", "client_message_id": "c24059cc-ba3b-4178-9733-c2a2d0e9e7ee", "server_message_id": "14b775e1-e32a-4a7b-a7dc-457c6b0b3062", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:11.480000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:11.519876+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "20260404查询运动记录", "client_message_id": "4a0b08e9-12e4-4bb0-b01e-bf0ba7af285b", "server_message_id": "a6260457-fa83-489c-b344-1f3c60fa7f22", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:34.943000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:43.911361+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你提供的2026-04-04是未来日期哦，运动记录仅支持查询不晚于今日的历史数据，请你核对日期后，提供正确的开始和结束日期（格式如2024-04-04），我会帮你查询相关记录~", "client_message_id": "adc659df-b3e1-4e1c-b084-8940f67f0913", "server_message_id": "d7c160d4-ead2-4117-bccc-6e0ff2acc329", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:43.883000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:43.922313+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "今天日期是？", "client_message_id": "cc51554a-3ec8-4d57-afd3-e53beaa88b90", "server_message_id": "feb06d38-3aa7-4420-a4bb-74527a187b3d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:04.277000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:37.837903+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱歉我暂时无法联网获取实时日期哦，你可以查看你设备上显示的今日日期，查询运动记录时提供的时间段只要不晚于你那边的今日日期就可以啦😉", "client_message_id": "c378a6ef-d551-4070-958a-35fcdd6aea95", "server_message_id": "06840e51-259d-49c9-b589-43fee71c521a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:37.816000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:37.851868+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我查下今天的运动记录呀", "client_message_id": "c37a9f16-ad1f-43af-939b-6ee4d3c087c2", "server_message_id": "94ec2286-7861-4658-9f5a-0d566b53be5f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:41.762000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:01.845047+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "麻烦你告知我今天的具体日期哦，格式为yyyy-MM-dd，我就可以马上帮你查询今日的运动记录啦~", "client_message_id": "f1eeb737-ad0a-42b1-9c69-a8d4cdc864a5", "server_message_id": "bebeb6c9-f33d-4e20-8959-6c58d25b696a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:01.811000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:01.857386+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "10db1a76-fafc-49b9-bee7-6f97c5999ae4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "b908bfa3-308f-430b-9511-e6245ad2321e", "server_message_id": "5ded605b-187e-478f-b7c3-13a14094d14c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:59.239000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:28:05.635433+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "8bb6660a-9c5b-4e2f-b9f6-191302b025e7", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "hi", "client_message_id": "3352d70c-5585-42e8-abdf-f49d3351a1dd", "server_message_id": "0873c782-4a66-4543-b31a-82b7d2f45bb5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:28:19.225000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:28:25.175544+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "8bb6660a-9c5b-4e2f-b9f6-191302b025e7", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "Hi there! I'm Spark Health Assistant, here to support you with health queries, activity tracking, nutrition planning, sleep analysis, medical record management and other health-related needs. How can I help you today?", "client_message_id": "5b19eced-bf1f-4b52-8af0-b500eac015de", "server_message_id": "8b70aa82-2c2e-4570-a980-ffb2aa308b86", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:28:25.146000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:28:25.186086+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么", "client_message_id": "c4ec03c7-bd10-43fb-9335-183a5d90bcc4", "server_message_id": "dab19c1a-8310-4c5d-b67a-cccddd4a1b2e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:04.346000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:11.506999+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我没办法自动获取你当前的实时日期哦，你告诉我今天的具体日期（格式参考：2024-06-15），我就能马上帮你查询今日的运动记录啦~", "client_message_id": "bf041b72-3ff7-471f-9d16-e731e5f77886", "server_message_id": "9d6809d9-53f3-4ce6-919a-d6a790aea5a3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:11.491000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:11.520799+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4b478e47-069b-4329-86ee-0ea9d73b92bd", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "6f2f62d6-cace-4839-8127-e83740114c85", "server_message_id": "110f4807-0b09-4b53-be21-cba5dd17d0a9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:42:17.658000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:42:21.915476+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "4b478e47-069b-4329-86ee-0ea9d73b92bd", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊我是你的专属健康助手Spark，不管是运动规划、饮食营养建议、睡眠质量分析，还是健康相关疑问咨询，我都可以帮到你~ 有什么需要帮忙的吗？", "client_message_id": "ca0ae54e-3948-4356-a9f3-0874e3ee47aa", "server_message_id": "174e0771-86fb-455e-9cdf-59caf086d653", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:42:24.407000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:42:24.430036+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊 我是Spark健康助手，如果你有健康相关的疑问，比如饮食运动建议、常见疾病护理、日常健康科普等，都可以随时告诉我哦！", "client_message_id": "d2a79dab-153a-45b0-9c67-c37259b7998f", "server_message_id": "ec4baa5b-82d8-4737-a0ee-f4306cfc540d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:19:16.359000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:00.658907+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "14c0b007-ca47-4961-9b3a-177cf2df204b", "server_message_id": "90595a91-7f92-494f-90ce-cda786f14c23", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:05.021000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:10.284654+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "又见面啦😉 还是有健康相关的问题想要咨询吗？不管是日常饮食运动建议、常见小问题护理还是健康科普都可以告诉我哦！", "client_message_id": "4fcc9b00-ff13-4e5d-9092-973fcccc20c6", "server_message_id": "287cac85-38d5-438a-af88-f500d7771b2c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:10.044000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:10.297585+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "fea22afd-baa8-4794-a5f5-f6409e6ebc81", "server_message_id": "c05f54ed-9bab-46bb-8196-fc879e724f9b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:42:08.401000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:42:11.542944+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈喽😊 又来啦！不管你是有身体不适的困扰、想要了解饮食运动的健康建议，还是想学习日常健康科普知识，都可以直接告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "0a7d2a46-0869-4a4c-a110-d5a0f1d9ba29", "server_message_id": "d478c6a2-6f96-4922-9ea4-ccdff7215e33", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:42:11.491000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:42:11.565852+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "发发发", "client_message_id": "dd5be3b0-d452-444c-b4d6-7bfe7123ca7e", "server_message_id": "cfe5221e-27df-45b8-998c-9db88455f363", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:08.305000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:13.041113+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "不好意思呀，我没太明白你的意思～如果你有健康方面的困扰或者想了解健康相关的知识，可以详细告诉我哦，我会尽力帮你~", "client_message_id": "8d9b95db-65bf-4d61-b186-52a58b3536c0", "server_message_id": "7ce74981-9f57-490c-a36d-938c9a32cae6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:12.986000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:13.058124+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "54659930-eaaf-4e20-95cb-b0a2d629aad0", "server_message_id": "8637e345-c9fb-46a5-8969-f71790929755", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:45.135000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:50.536483+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看来你心情很不错呀😉 如果有运动、饮食、睡眠、健康管理相关的需求都可以随时和我说哦~", "client_message_id": "0d228040-8d4b-49e6-b0c2-171140208756", "server_message_id": "1dcd0924-9a53-48d4-8f30-49f7aee766b4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:50.509000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:50.551419+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么 什么", "client_message_id": "0511c9fc-43d4-4cc1-bb92-3f4bbd90128b", "server_message_id": "fbb6b9a3-c0cf-4537-82ca-a679b091045f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:34.406000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:41.564450+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你是有什么具体的健康相关问题想问吗？比如饮食搭配、运动方案、睡眠调整、健康报告解读这些都可以哦，你说清楚需求我就能帮你啦😉", "client_message_id": "79cbb975-e97e-458a-893c-155f5c9de9a3", "server_message_id": "520c5fac-6bbb-45c8-8ac9-65f9a5be8082", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:41.485000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:41.594090+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "给我输出图书馆的历史 现状 和未来 发展", "client_message_id": "b28b7848-5e94-46b5-8cbf-11d723f999fe", "server_message_id": "bb24d2af-2c23-41de-86ff-468b117c0cc4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:18.390000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:57.044118+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "### 一、图书馆的发展历史\n1. 古代阶段：公元前3000年左右两河流域就出现了最早的泥板文献馆藏，中国古代的藏书阁（如天一阁）、宫廷藏书机构是早期形态，主要服务于贵族、学者，不对普通公众开放。\n2. 近代阶段：19世纪中期现代公共图书馆在欧美诞生，中国1904年建成第一座公共图书馆（湖北图书馆），核心功能转向文献保存、公共借阅，面向普通民众开放。\n3. 现代阶段：20世纪90年代后随着互联网发展，图书馆逐步开启数字化转型，从单一的纸质文献存储借阅机构，向数字资源服务、文化空间功能拓展。\n\n### 二、当前发展现状\n1. 服务融合：传统纸质文献借阅+数字资源服务并行，全国多数公共图书馆已经上线电子图书、期刊、音视频资源库，支持在线阅览、24小时自助借还、通借通还。\n2. 功能拓展：不再只是藏书借书的场所，已经成为公共文化空间，普遍提供亲子阅读、文化讲座、展览、学习自习、公益培训等多元服务，部分区域还配套了创业孵化、老年/特殊群体关怀服务。\n3. 智慧化升级：刷脸借阅、智能书架、无人值守图书馆已经在很多城市普及，部分试点智慧图书馆已经实现了资源智能推荐、VR/AR阅读体验等功能。\n\n### 三、未来发展趋势\n1. 深度数字化：元宇宙图书馆、数字孪生馆藏会逐步落地，用户可以在线上3D空间漫游馆区、沉浸式体验古籍、数字展览，不受物理空间限制。\n2. 精准化服务：基于用户阅读习惯的个性化资源推送、知识定制服务会成为主流，从“人找资源”转向“资源找人”，针对不同群体（学生、老年、职场人）提供定制化的知识服务。\n3. 场景化渗透：会进一步和社区、商圈、园区融合，出现更多嵌入式微型图书馆，实现“15分钟阅读圈”，从集中式的大馆，变成覆盖生活全场景的公共文化服务节点。\n4. 价值升级：从文献存储借阅机构，升级为公共知识加工、文化传承的核心载体，承担更多知识普及、文化交流、社会教育的功能。", "client_message_id": "7e613c34-22a4-428f-8b92-07faf78045d1", "server_message_id": "52a41bb3-16ca-4bfe-9ac6-027a6034daad", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:56.990000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:57.056087+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "f5836c9b-5fab-4b21-8b03-9fec7d66dac4", "server_message_id": "870f602a-fe34-4c09-9392-813add3c55d5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:23:44.863000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:23:51.599789+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊 我是你的专属健康助手，不管是运动规划、饮食建议、睡眠调整、健康报告解读这类健康相关的需求，都可以随时和我说哦~", "client_message_id": "d8475587-26a8-47cd-91e7-23a444009a85", "server_message_id": "d64208e0-8d90-4029-86d4-84ea20b52759", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:23:51.550000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:23:51.619182+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "969dfb1f-4717-492c-af15-db81221c812b", "server_message_id": "d70213f9-bcf9-44a0-9972-8f9f4b686c60", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:24:18.911000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:24:25.545993+00:00", "tombstone": false}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "😆看起来你心情超好呀～要是有关于健康的问题，比如想查运动数据、做饮食规划、问睡眠调整建议之类的，随时告诉我就可以哦！", "client_message_id": "46c3d521-10e4