INFO 2026-04-13 14:32:10,916 accounts.api_io [request_id=32BD0C72-2167-4BB7-AE74-AB8131784E3C] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2MDkxMjkwLCJpYXQiOjE3NzYwODk0OTAsImp0aSI6IjMwMGYxYzUyOTU3NDRmOTg4ZDE4YzdkNjQ5YTllZmJlIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.HaMnv5kED6vIoLZV5B58QvwaHsbVVzVrb1lgtfwbjDk", "X-Request-Id": "32BD0C72-2167-4BB7-AE74-AB8131784E3C", "Content-Length": "1982"} body={"messages": [{"reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "B326C702-BE4A-41A2-BB23-91A2489EB508", "tombstone": false, "content": "你会做什么呀", "attachments": [], "role": "user", "thread_id": "72758502-9EB7-4724-AAC3-EE0F279630E6", "delivery_state": "pending", "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:32:08.259Z"}, {"reasoning_duration_ms": 489, "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:32:10.883Z", "role": "assistant", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_content": "用户想了解我能做什么，这是关于我的功能范围的问题。作为Spark健康助手，我应该清晰、简洁地介绍我的核心功能，让用户知道如何充分利用我来管理健康。\n\n我需要根据工具列表来总结我能提供的服务，但不要罗列所有技术细节，而是用用户能理解的方式说明。", "attachments": [], "reasoning_visibility": "full", "delivery_state": "pending", "tombstone": false, "kind": "text", "content": "我可以帮您做这些健康管理相关的事情：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 **健康数据查看**\n- 步数、运动记录追踪\n- 热量消耗与摄入分析\n- 睡眠质量评估\n- 体检报告/医疗记录查询\n\n## 🩺 **健康建议**\n- 基于病历和体检报告的解读\n- 饮食调理建议（如您的胃炎）\n- 用药提醒与管理\n- 就诊/复查安排规划\n\n## 📝 **知识管理**\n- 创建健康笔记/知识库\n- 整理健康计划文档\n\n## 🗓️ **日程提醒**\n- 体检/复诊日历\n- 服药提醒设置\n\n## 🔍 **信息查询**\n- 天气与出行健康提示\n- 周边医疗机构查找\n- 学术资料检索\n\n---\n\n**比如您现在可以：**\n- 🏥 让我帮您安排阻生牙拔除复查时间\n- 📋 解读甲状腺囊肿的专科治疗建议\n- 🍽️ 根据胃炎情况定制饮食方案\n- 📅 设置血常规复查提醒\n\n有什么具体需求吗？😊", "thread_id": "72758502-9EB7-4724-AAC3-EE0F279630E6", "client_message_id": "7C072EBE-9A97-4302-8E74-709DCDECD9C6"}]}
