INFO 2026-04-13 14:52:26,822 accounts.api_io [request_id=88D0C71B-F701-4404-A945-FEC6BD309129] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=13 bytes=15099 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDVUMDM6MzY6NTEuMzk0MzY3KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI3MDYifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "发发发", "client_message_id": "dd5be3b0-d452-444c-b4d6-7bfe7123ca7e", "server_message_id": "cfe5221e-27df-45b8-998c-9db88455f363", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:08.305000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:13.041113+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "不好意思呀，我没太明白你的意思～如果你有健康方面的困扰或者想了解健康相关的知识，可以详细告诉我哦，我会尽力帮你~", "client_message_id": "8d9b95db-65bf-4d61-b186-52a58b3536c0", "server_message_id": "7ce74981-9f57-490c-a36d-938c9a32cae6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:12.986000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:01:13.058124+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "54659930-eaaf-4e20-95cb-b0a2d629aad0", "server_message_id": "8637e345-c9fb-46a5-8969-f71790929755", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:45.135000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:50.536483+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看来你心情很不错呀😉 如果有运动、饮食、睡眠、健康管理相关的需求都可以随时和我说哦~", "client_message_id": "0d228040-8d4b-49e6-b0c2-171140208756", "server_message_id": "1dcd0924-9a53-48d4-8f30-49f7aee766b4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:50.509000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:03:50.551419+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么 什么", "client_message_id": "0511c9fc-43d4-4cc1-bb92-3f4bbd90128b", "server_message_id": "fbb6b9a3-c0cf-4537-82ca-a679b091045f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:34.406000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:41.564450+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你是有什么具体的健康相关问题想问吗？比如饮食搭配、运动方案、睡眠调整、健康报告解读这些都可以哦，你说清楚需求我就能帮你啦😉", "client_message_id": "79cbb975-e97e-458a-893c-155f5c9de9a3", "server_message_id": "520c5fac-6bbb-45c8-8ac9-65f9a5be8082", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:41.485000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:04:41.594090+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "给我输出图书馆的历史 现状 和未来 发展", "client_message_id": "b28b7848-5e94-46b5-8cbf-11d723f999fe", "server_message_id": "bb24d2af-2c23-41de-86ff-468b117c0cc4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:18.390000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:57.044118+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "### 一、图书馆的发展历史\n1. 古代阶段：公元前3000年左右两河流域就出现了最早的泥板文献馆藏，中国古代的藏书阁（如天一阁）、宫廷藏书机构是早期形态，主要服务于贵族、学者，不对普通公众开放。\n2. 近代阶段：19世纪中期现代公共图书馆在欧美诞生，中国1904年建成第一座公共图书馆（湖北图书馆），核心功能转向文献保存、公共借阅，面向普通民众开放。\n3. 现代阶段：20世纪90年代后随着互联网发展，图书馆逐步开启数字化转型，从单一的纸质文献存储借阅机构，向数字资源服务、文化空间功能拓展。\n\n### 二、当前发展现状\n1. 服务融合：传统纸质文献借阅+数字资源服务并行，全国多数公共图书馆已经上线电子图书、期刊、音视频资源库，支持在线阅览、24小时自助借还、通借通还。\n2. 功能拓展：不再只是藏书借书的场所，已经成为公共文化空间，普遍提供亲子阅读、文化讲座、展览、学习自习、公益培训等多元服务，部分区域还配套了创业孵化、老年/特殊群体关怀服务。\n3. 智慧化升级：刷脸借阅、智能书架、无人值守图书馆已经在很多城市普及，部分试点智慧图书馆已经实现了资源智能推荐、VR/AR阅读体验等功能。\n\n### 三、未来发展趋势\n1. 深度数字化：元宇宙图书馆、数字孪生馆藏会逐步落地，用户可以在线上3D空间漫游馆区、沉浸式体验古籍、数字展览，不受物理空间限制。\n2. 精准化服务：基于用户阅读习惯的个性化资源推送、知识定制服务会成为主流，从“人找资源”转向“资源找人”，针对不同群体（学生、老年、职场人）提供定制化的知识服务。\n3. 场景化渗透：会进一步和社区、商圈、园区融合，出现更多嵌入式微型图书馆，实现“15分钟阅读圈”，从集中式的大馆，变成覆盖生活全场景的公共文化服务节点。\n4. 价值升级：从文献存储借阅机构，升级为公共知识加工、文化传承的核心载体，承担更多知识普及、文化交流、社会教育的功能。", "client_message_id": "7e613c34-22a4-428f-8b92-07faf78045d1", "server_message_id": "52a41bb3-16ca-4bfe-9ac6-027a6034daad", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:56.990000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:05:57.056087+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "0868a28e-c27f-4f6e-8e92-65001d1579c2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "f5836c9b-5fab-4b21-8b03-9fec7d66dac4", "server_message_id": "870f602a-fe34-4c09-9392-813add3c55d5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:23:44.863000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:23:51.599789+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expand