ing_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是你的专属健康助手Spark✨ 可以帮你解读健康报告、解答用药疑问、提供健康生活建议，也能帮你记录和管理健康相关的信息。\n你有任何健康相关的问题都可以随时和我说~", "client_message_id": "9bb37b28-7479-40ec-a884-f1c04ca7463e", "server_message_id": "bbe7f190-d3db-451a-acec-a23d63740cb7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:37.546000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:37.610799+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么情况", "client_message_id": "cda92d82-6457-472f-abd9-8b1fc040bd2b", "server_message_id": "a88d1ae6-0e23-41f3-a2b7-de7f73e910d1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:44.246000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:48.968881+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请问你是对之前提供的用药/检查记录有疑问，还是身体有不舒服的情况呀？可以具体描述下你的问题，我会尽力帮你解答😊", "client_message_id": "49372e44-948e-4669-95f7-e3578ee4c4af", "server_message_id": "d32863b6-bfcd-4a95-b886-43eae7ade872", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:48.927000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:48.978280+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么情况", "client_message_id": "212ab9da-1ea3-425b-9acd-1148f5362f33", "server_message_id": "0b59d1b0-6dea-48fa-b009-0378b4486e6a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:05:04.