ull}, {"thread_id": "b072a8ab-93f7-4a6a-9fee-ecda93aeaac0", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是你的专属健康助手Spark健康助手，可以为你提供用药指导、健康报告解读、健康生活建议，还能帮你查询运动、睡眠、饮食等健康数据，有需要可以随时告诉我你的需求~", "client_message_id": "233d4a9c-3516-4c88-96c6-2cffcff06741", "server_message_id": "a6449293-920b-432c-9d0c-7dda16e7a07a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-11T10:09:21.582000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-11T10:09:21.629534+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "b072a8ab-93f7-4a6a-9fee-ecda93aeaac0", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我是谁 ？", "client_message_id": "68601567-9c40-48f4-a6d0-3e50703b5422", "server_message_id": "e10dfae2-2ef2-4ebf-9b73-9b1559e26ef4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-11T10:28:27.857000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-11T10:28:30.301310+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "b072a8ab-93f7-4a6a-9fee-ecda93aeaac0", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我没办法直接获取你的个人身份信息哦~ 不过你可以告诉我你的姓名、年龄等基础信息，或者通过`find_member`工具查找你的成员档案，我就能更好地为你提供个性化的健康服务啦😉", "client_message_id": "bfdc80ad-871c-4023-8a81-afe1d23b9f73", "server_message_id": "5191ed2f-0e06-4bc7-bd8c-fc93f84b1525", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-11T10:28:30.247000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-11T10:28:30.313280+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "b072a8ab-93f7-4a6a-9fee-ecda93aeaac0", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "48f66f4f-4d7d-48ee-82d9-4482e4dca576", "server_message_id": "7bb30509-5723-47ca-b4a7-273123a835e8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-