INFO 2026-04-13 14:52:27,622 accounts.api_io [request_id=A05385DA-9150-4AF5-9EBF-4D5BE036544D] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=5991 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTNUMDM6NTY6NDkuMjg3MjQzKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI4MTUifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "d621ece0-43eb-4545-8e04-de020964ae8e", "server_message_id": "2d176bd8-1969-46f0-870d-1322434e58ee", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:34.106000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:39.452594+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！👋 我是你的健康助手 Spark，很高兴为你服务。\n\n我可以帮你：\n- 📊 查看健康数据（步数、睡眠、运动、饮食等）\n- 📋 管理病历和体检报告\n- 💊 记录用药提醒\n- 🏥 查找医院/药店位置\n- 📅 设置健康相关的日程提醒\n- 🔍 解答健康相关问题\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？", "client_message_id": "cd814ab2-4d2f-4912-99b8-1254d1fea94b", "server_message_id": "12a22051-8ac8-43e8-8685-c5d6a1e20598", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:39.411000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:39.463076+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "6d47ac1e-837d-41b7-9f17-dd44493db4ed", "server_message_id": "36c65972-9f1b-47b2-abce-0e31e432de39", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:46.347000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:57.203777+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！我是 **Spark 健康助手**，专门帮你管理健康相关的事务。以下是我能做的事情：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 **健康数据追踪**\n- 查看步数、能量消耗、睡眠时长与质量\n- 分析运动记录（跑步、骑行、步行等）\n- 记录和统计饮食营养摄入\n\n## 📋 **病历与报告管理**\n- 查看和整理病历、体检报告\n- 生成结构化的健康卡片\n- 解读检查报告（需要拍照上传）\n\n## 💊 **用药管理**\n- 设置用药提醒\n- 记录药品信息\n- 提醒复查时间\n\n## 📅 **日程与提醒**\n- 创建健康相关的日历事件\n- 设置体检、复诊、用药提醒\n- 查看已有日程\n\n## 🗺️ **位置与导航**\n- 查找附近的医院、药店、健身房\n- 规划路线（步行、驾车、公交）\n- 查询天气，为出行做准备\n\n## 🔍 **知识查询**\n- 搜索健康知识\n- 查找学术文献\n- 检索你保存的笔记和文档\n\n## 📝 **记忆与笔记**\n- 保存重要健康信息到长期记忆\n- 创建知识文档\n\n---\n\n**你现在想做什么？** 比如查看今天的步数、记录一次饮食、或者设置一个提醒？", "client_message_id": "56999445-a023-40d4-9293-d979fd56ce9d", "server_message_id": "73880e7e-d0e0-4348-87a8-c563af35e6e6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:57.149000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:54:57.210189+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我创建图书馆知识库", "client_message_id": "55f30026-bda3-4b27-8fa4-f62017cdf9e4", "server_message_id": "00ed4ce6-e704-46b6-8c74-951783cee211", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:55:21.711000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:55:30.218906+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我可以帮你创建一个关于**图书馆**的知识文档！不过为了更有针对性，请告诉我：\n\n1. **主题方向** — 你想创建哪种类型的图书馆知识库？\n   - 📚 图书馆学/信息管理专业资料\n   - 🏛️ 特定图书馆介绍（如学校图书馆、公共图书馆）\n   - 📖 图书分类与检索方法\n   - 💻 数字图书馆/电子资源使用指南\n   - 🔧 图书馆管理系统（如借阅系统、馆藏管理）\n   - 其他：______\n\n2. **用途** — 主要给谁用？\n   - 个人学习笔记\n   - 学生/读者使用指南\n   - 图书馆员工作手册\n   - 其他\n\n3. **已有内容** — 你有现成的资料需要整理进去吗？（可以粘贴文字或提供链接）\n\n告诉我这些信息，我就能帮你创建一个结构清晰、内容实用的知识库文档！ 🎯", "client_message_id": "489cd188-04f2-460a-b917-538127e6745b", "server_message_id": "22dd6365-5b5c-4117-97fa-37640fc2a608", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:55:30.184000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:55:30.227442+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7d021a4b-2542-444e-b7aa-3222d76febc5", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "个人学习", "client_message_id": "a54c2f90-f141-4cd0-8508-517928da3148", "server_message_id": "6f81700d-7901-41fc-930d-6e85d3f5dd5e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:56:04.674000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:56:49.287243+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
