INFO 2026-04-13 14:52:27,648 accounts.api_io [request_id=6DB866D4-05FA-468A-937E-64557D3298E2] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=5457 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTNUMDM6NTk6MTkuMTgzNTQxKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI4MjEifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我创建个人学习的知识库 计算机知识", "client_message_id": "d63cfc5d-5e84-463d-9875-843ea54deeb1", "server_message_id": "713c452b-948b-45d8-9433-0927263c27f7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:57:56.834000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:04.433113+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "✅ 已成功为您创建「计算机知识」个人学习知识库！\n\n文档已包含以下核心内容：\n- 计算机硬件与操作系统基础\n- 主流编程语言及应用场景\n- 数据结构与经典算法\n- 数据库（关系型与非关系型）\n- 网络协议与OSI模型\n- 软件开发模式与设计模式\n- 人工智能、云计算等前沿技术方向\n\n📌 **使用建议**：\n1. 可在后续对话中随时补充具体知识点（如：\"添加Python机器学习入门\"）\n2. 定期通过「检索本地知识背包」功能回顾重点内容\n3. 结合实际项目实践深化理解，将经验记录到知识库中\n\n需要我帮您扩展某个专题或整理学习路径吗？", "client_message_id": "97e82bb8-d344-4656-add9-0f9731276f2a", "server_message_id": "49afc1c9-9ddf-42e3-9eeb-ba0e4accb2a2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:04.386000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:04.441665+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么", "client_message_id": "f3956209-5ace-431a-91e0-ef9af895b48e", "server_message_id": "370a8c63-f20f-44ac-9d62-37746f5cc034", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:15.445000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:19.985506+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我的意思是：我已经帮您创建了一个关于「计算机知识」的学习知识库，里面整理了以下核心内容：\n\n| 模块 | 主要内容 |\n|------|---------|\n| 🖥️ 硬件与系统 | CPU、内存、操作系统基础 |\n| 💻 编程语言 | Python/Java/C++等应用场景 |\n| 🔧 算法数据结构 | 排序、查找、树、图等 |\n| 🗄️ 数据库 | MySQL、MongoDB 等 |\n| 🌐 网络基础 | HTTP、TCP/IP、OSI模型 |\n| ⚙️ 开发模式 | MVC、微服务、设计模式 |\n| 🤖 前沿技术 | AI、云计算、大数据方向 |\n\n**您可以这样使用：**\n- ✅ **补充知识点**：如\"添加Python深度学习入门\"\n- ✅ **检索回顾**：随时问\"查一下机器学习基础\"\n- ✅ **整理路径**：让我帮您规划学习路线\n\n需要我详细说明某个部分，或者帮您规划学习顺序吗？", "client_message_id": "95c4c32b-8525-4e1c-b902-7825a8add010", "server_message_id": "d188bc4f-caa4-4af6-b4ca-8493b98d2b20", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:19.941000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:19.993418+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "创建网络知识的 知识库", "client_message_id": "bd2b52e8-4da0-45f5-b252-ffe7ad62d49f", "server_message_id": "0b692a1d-8fd4-44f0-b544-58d9adaecc69", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:59:05.454000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:59:19.173875+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "✅ 已成功创建「网络知识」知识库！\n\n文档涵盖以下核心内容：\n- 🌐 **OSI七层模型**与TCP/IP协议栈详解\n- 🔢 **IP地址与子网划分**（IPv4/IPv6）\n- 📡 **常见网络设备**功能对比（交换机/路由器等）\n- 🌍 **DNS域名系统**解析机制\n- 📡 **HTTP/HTTPS协议**详解（请求方法/状态码）\n- 🔒 **网络安全基础**与防护策略\n- 🛠️ **网络诊断工具**使用指南\n\n📌 **使用方式**：\n- 补充专题：如\"添加BGP路由协议详解\"\n- 深入讲解：如\"解释TCP三次握手过程\"\n- 实践指导：如\"如何用Wireshark分析流量\"\n\n需要我帮您规划网络知识学习路径，或深入某个具体主题吗？", "client_message_id": "0e434366-0076-4554-8d82-8d82fae40eb5", "server_message_id": "c8d87e92-4931-4bae-afd6-13e8f35424b9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:59:19.129000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:59:19.183541+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
