INFO 2026-04-13 14:52:27,818 accounts.api_io [request_id=9DC27ACA-FF16-40CB-9BC2-DC40BD06495F] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=4948 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTNUMDQ6MjU6MDMuNDkwMjU2KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI4NDUifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "768d37d7-6920-47af-a61e-c874eafac5ef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "69b9a37e-4535-4292-9f78-87804a31554c", "server_message_id": "58621c45-b1b6-4f52-bb9a-52a5442371b6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:06.752000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:10.374293+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "768d37d7-6920-47af-a61e-c874eafac5ef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！👋 我是 Spark 健康助手，很高兴为您服务。\n\n我可以帮助您：\n- 📊 **健康数据查询**：步数、睡眠、运动、营养摄入等\n- 🏥 **医疗记录分析**：病历、体检报告解读\n- 💊 **用药提醒**：药物管理建议\n- 🩺 **健康建议**：基于您的健康状况提供个性化指导\n\n从您的近期病历来看，有以下几项需要注意：\n- **阻生牙**（建议择期拔除）\n- **慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流**\n- **窦性心动过缓**（无症状通常无需治疗）\n- **甲状腺囊肿**（建议专科治疗）\n- **血常规部分指标异常**（建议复查）\n\n请问您今天想了解什么？或者有什么健康问题需要咨询？😊", "client_message_id": "f5589911-f124-4221-b390-b7d5207d7fe1", "server_message_id": "94b78df2-3119-45e1-aff0-078779740761", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:10.351000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:10.386188+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "768d37d7-6920-47af-a61e-c874eafac5ef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么", "client_message_id": "bb2af14a-3200-475c-a773-f2e8d78c829a", "server_message_id": "ab8b4efd-63d5-412a-a3cb-b7dcb96b4537", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:37.018000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:39.882583+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "768d37d7-6920-47af-a61e-c874eafac5ef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好！😊 \n\n看到您发\"什么\"，我不太确定您具体想了解什么。我可以帮您做这些事情：\n\n**📋 可以为您查询：**\n- 步数、睡眠、运动、能量消耗等健康数据\n- 饮食营养摄入情况\n- 日历和提醒事项\n- 成员健康档案（用药、体检报告等）\n\n**💡 近期健康提醒：**\n根据您最近的病历，有几项需要关注：\n| 项目 | 建议 |\n|------|------|\n| 阻生牙 | 择期拔除，避免发炎感染 |\n| 胃炎伴胆汁反流 | 清淡饮食，规律进食 |\n| 甲状腺囊肿 | 专科复查 |\n| 血常规异常 | 及时复查 |\n\n**❓ 请问您想了解：**\n1. 某方面的详细数据？（如最近一周的睡眠/运动情况）\n2. 对某份医疗报告有疑问？\n3. 需要健康建议或饮食指导？\n4. 还是其他问题？\n\n请告诉我您的需求，我会尽力帮您！✨", "client_message_id": "ada83ab9-01e8-4099-8426-c72f8f5dcf94", "server_message_id": "1697ae93-d048-46f4-b490-a8bd8cf53f10", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:39.866000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:39.891565+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "768d37d7-6920-47af-a61e-c874eafac5ef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "太快了", "client_message_id": "fea4c96e-2412-44fb-8d6c-ea9d751b34e5", "server_message_id": "bd8e782c-9250-48b0-a7b5-061dc4ce8b0b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:24:53.404000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:25:03.480874+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "768d37d7-6920-47af-a61e-c874eafac5ef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱歉呀~ 刚才一下子给了你太多信息，让你觉得有点赶了😅 我们慢慢来就好😊 你现在最想了解哪方面的内容呢？比如是想查看健康数据、解读体检报告，还是有其他健康相关的问题呀？", "client_message_id": "f31e77e9-3572-4c48-b014-4069bf5abf1a", "server_message_id": "af33d519-a12d-486f-96c2-04195994e941", "delive