INFO 2026-04-13 15:02:06,369 accounts.api_io [request_id=004177BC-CDDB-469A-9341-B6D231471CA0] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=1100 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDRUMTQ6Mzc6MjUuODgyMTk4KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2NDMifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我目前暂时无法调用外部实时工具哦~不过我内置了经过专业审核的健康、医学相关知识库，能够满足大部分日常健康咨询需求，比如常见轻症居家缓解方法、不同人群膳食搭配指导、健康谣言辨别、慢病日常护理建议等，你有相关需求都可以直接说明。\n\n⚠️ 我的所有建议仅供参考，不能替代执业医师的当面诊断，如有急症、重症请第一时间就医哦。", "client_message_id": "ea30f5c5-296f-4f58-8dd1-f9febd11ee90", "server_message_id": "0776666f-ed96-49d0-9594-60662ec5144d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.808000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.882198+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
