INFO 2026-04-13 15:21:08,181 accounts.api_io [request_id=147C7915-C156-4369-B803-3D03CE1CA3C0] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=6 bytes=4907 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTNUMTM6NTk6MDkuODcwNTMwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI4NjMifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "d94579e4-29dc-47e9-af7c-458b259d1195", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "eb1266e3-6c5d-4464-8dec-62797e459a64", "server_message_id": "33fbe894-7865-4638-96fe-2d802ca17a0d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T13:49:49.393000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T13:49:52.540528+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d94579e4-29dc-47e9-af7c-458b259d1195", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！👋 我是 Spark 健康助手，很高兴为你服务。\n\n根据你最近的病历记录，我看到你有几个需要关注的健康问题：\n\n**当前主要关注点：**\n- 🦷 **阻生牙** - 建议择期拔除\n- 🍽️ **慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流** - 注意饮食调理\n- ❤️ **窦性心动过缓** - 若无症状通常无需治疗\n- 🧪 **血液指标异常**（血小板、淋巴细胞等）- 建议复查\n\n**我能帮你：**\n✅ 生成健康计划与提醒  \n✅ 分析体检/化验报告  \n✅ 查询周边医疗机构  \n✅ 记录饮食与运动数据  \n\n有什么具体想咨询的吗？比如：\n- 预约口腔检查/拔牙\n- 饮食建议改善胃部不适\n- 复查血液指标的注意事项\n- 其他健康管理问题", "client_message_id": "442739e6-ea1e-4f99-9338-2a6aaa61b0cb", "server_message_id": "c074ea56-bb6f-4eed-90af-7e1567be2bfc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T13:49:52.513000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T13:49:52.549066+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d94579e4-29dc-47e9-af7c-458b259d1195", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我生成 口腔知识", "client_message_id": "c696cba0-b5f1-4dd0-bf1d-1716de509465", "server_message_id": "53544b2f-399d-490a-96ef-955037d8de57", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T13:50:15.901000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T13:50:24.348556+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d94579e4-29dc-47e9-af7c-458b259d1195", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为您生成《口腔健康指南》知识卡片！📋✨\n\n**内容亮点：**\n- ✅ 阻生牙专题（定义/拔除时机/术前术后护理）\n- ✅ 日常护理详解（巴氏刷牙法/清洁工具/饮食建议）\n- ✅ 就诊信号与定期维护提醒\n- ✅ 结合您的诊疗记录生成个性化建议\n\n您可以点击保存将此文档加入知识库，方便随时查阅。需要我帮您：\n1️⃣ 预约苏州大学附属第四医院口腔科拔牙  \n2️⃣ 制定胃部调理饮食计划  \n3️⃣ 查询周边牙科诊所  \n\n有什么具体需求吗？😊", "client_message_id": "f4e0339c-7326-40ed-8a35-1c38ddfc847a", "server_message_id": "5d2826ff-1e6c-47d6-a9ac-a2f1aa26785a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T13:50:24.333000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T13:50:24.355275+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d94579e4-29dc-47e9-af7c-458b259d1195", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈\n吧不好办呀啊这", "client_message_id": "89ae2904-f377-4738-a4ee-11a5c95ae63e", "server_message_id": "136eacf5-2cad-4a92-94ce-bd6b637db8b3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T13:58:50.335000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T13:59:09.858081+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d94579e4-29dc-47e9-af7c-458b259d1195", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "😄 哈哈，没关系！看起来您可能打字手滑了，或者想表达点别的？\n\n没关系，慢慢来～ 您是想：\n\n1. **预约拔牙**？我可以帮您查询医院或设置提醒\n2. **了解更多口腔护理细节**？比如阻生牙术后怎么吃东西\n3. **聊聊别的健康话题**？比如胃炎饮食、复查血指标\n4. **还是单纯想闲聊**？😂\n\n您直接说，我都在！👂", "client_message_id": "6c9034c0-1e2f-4a95-8aff-a179d99377da", "server_message_id": "e09c83cd-5da2-4dc5-8eba-3145b6a0f2d6", "delivery_state": "sent", "cre