INFO 2026-04-13 15:21:08,193 accounts.api_io [request_id=A947D5A6-79D5-4012-94D9-025B39C4964C] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=4806 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTNUMTQ6Mjc6MzguNTkzNjUyKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI4NjkifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "83965053-337b-441e-bf5c-f6ab894f111d", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "0946a646-f8fe-499f-ba83-1e02d1f6d6a5", "server_message_id": "51449424-09fa-4bec-9c6d-a0d45a636c75", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:30.686000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:37.099174+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "83965053-337b-441e-bf5c-f6ab894f111d", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀！👋 我是你的健康助手 Spark，很高兴为你服务！\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？比如：\n- 查看你的健康数据（步数、睡眠、运动等）\n- 分析体检报告或病历\n- 制定健康计划\n- 解答健康相关问题\n\n随时告诉我你的需求 😊", "client_message_id": "d94e7536-3e67-4030-991f-6adca083e76a", "server_message_id": "83c88f95-672e-4645-bc25-b422730d9699", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:37.086000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:37.109448+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "83965053-337b-441e-bf5c-f6ab894f111d", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你在干嘛呢", "client_message_id": "d667bb9b-8427-43f4-ab20-4ed6293b3fd2", "server_message_id": "b49fca99-eb0c-4a30-86a0-36c294e44fb5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:41.083000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:47.674017+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "83965053-337b-441e-bf5c-f6ab894f111d", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我正在这里待命，随时准备帮你处理健康相关的事情呢！😊\n\n看你之前的病历记录，最近有：\n- 阻生牙的情况（建议择期拔除）\n- 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n- 体检发现窦性心动过缓、甲状腺囊肿等\n\n有什么想聊的吗？比如：\n- 复查提醒\n- 饮食建议\n- 或者就是随便聊聊健康话题\n\n我都在～", "client_message_id": "393f5b4a-7d5f-4ef6-85cb-2b4aa470cc97", "server_message_id": "0f7840e4-cecf-4db5-a07a-f03fffd53642", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:47.616000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T14:25:47.682786+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "83965053-337b-441e-bf5c-f6ab894f111d", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我生成 赛马的相关的知识库", "client_message_id": "10e5d07d-04e1-4789-8ac7-4ff3a793fa19", "server_message_id": "17afee84-f8a6-4457-b638-eb285f64943c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:26:12.033000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T14:27:38.580455+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "83965053-337b-441e-bf5c-f6ab894f111d", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我已经为你生成了一份**赛马知识库草稿** 🐎，内容涵盖：\n\n## 📋 知识库内容概览\n\n| 章节 | 主要内容 |\n|------|----------|\n| **运动概述** | 赛马类型（平地赛、障碍赛、耐力赛等） |\n| **马匹品种** | 纯血马、阿拉伯马、夸特马、标准马 |\n| **顶级赛事** | 三冠王、墨尔本杯、迪拜世界杯等 |\n| **比赛规则** | 参赛资格、比赛流程、违规判定 |\n| **训练体系** | 日常训练安排、关键角色分工 |\n| **博彩基础** | 独赢、连赢、三重彩等玩法 |\n| **中国赛马** | 香港、内地赛马场现状 |\n| **趣闻术语** | 传奇赛马、专业术语 |\n\n---\n\n💾 **保存提示**：这是一份预览草稿，如果你满意的话，可以点击保存将其存入你的知识背包中。之后随时可以通过搜索来查阅！\n\n需要我补充什么内容吗？比如：\n- 特定国家/地区的赛马详情\n- 赛马投注策略\n- 马术与赛马的区别", "client_message_id": "8ea883f1-b18e-4aba-81af-92bcdb959deb", "server_message_id": "ca0f17de-fb22-4510-a98d-4c6cdab9b1c3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-